===Etymology 1===
[[File:Noodle Kugel.jpg|thumb|A [[serving#Noun|serving]] of kugel ''({{senseno|en|dish}})''.]]

Borrowed from {{bor|en|yi|קוגל}} (referring to the inflated appearance of some puddings), from {{der|en|gmh|kugel|t=ball; globe}} (modern {{cog|de|Kugel|t=ball; (''astronomy'') celestial body, orb; (''geometry'') sphere}}); further etymology uncertain.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=n|id=9410148321|date=March 2024|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=n}}</ref>

====Noun====
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{senseid|en|dish}} A [[traditional#Adjective|traditional]] [[savory#Adjective|savoury]] or [[sweet#Adjective|sweet]] [[Jewish#Adjective|Jewish]] [[dish#Noun|dish]] [[consist]]ing of a [[baked#Adjective|baked]] [[pudding]] of [[pasta]], [[potato#Noun|potatoes]], or [[rice#Noun|rice]], with [[vegetable#Noun|vegetables]], or [[raisin#Noun|raisins]] and [[spice#Noun|spices]].
#* {{quote-song|en|title=Hey Fuck You|album=w:To the 5 Boroughs|year=2004|artist=w:Beastie Boys|passage=With the dipsy-doodle, the kit and caboodle / The truth is brutal, your grandma's '''kugel'''}}
# {{lb|en|by extension|South Africa|derogatory|slang}} A [[wealthy]] [[young#Adjective|young]] Jewish [[woman#Noun|woman]] [[characterize]]d as [[materialistic]] and [[selfish]].
#: {{synonyms|en|JAP<q:Australia, US>}}
#: {{coordinate terms|en|bagel<q:South Africa, derogatory, slang>}}

